while he first appeared in ant-man and  the wasp one division has officially  made jimmy woo a major part of the mcu  this is his history in the comics from  his 1950s origins to his time leading  the agents of atlas  wu's first comic book appearance came in  1956's four part mini-series yellow claw  which was published by marvel when they  were known as atlas comics  in the comic wu is a chinese-american  fbi agent tasked with hunting down the  yellow claw  an ancient chinese mystic who seeks to  conquer the world  unsurprisingly this comic features many  racist depictions of asian people with  the yellow claw himself being a yellow  peril caricature  however jimmy wu is a positive exception  to the largely negative depictions of  asian characters and comics of the era  according to columnist jeff yang  the first issue features a fairly  clear-cut espionage story but yellow  claw goes to some wild places in the  next few issues  each story sees wu foil the claw's plan  before he escapes  the claw's granny suwan who we recruited  to aid him in his quest for world  domination secretly helps woo throughout  the mini-series  wu went dormant for 10 years following  his debut then he returned to marvel  comics which had successfully rebranded  itself away from its atlas days  in 1967 strange tales number 160 captain  america brings wood and nick fury at  shield headquarters because he might  have a lead on an ongoing case called  project blackout  fury then tells the duo how he and cap  investigated a mysterious force inside  the statue of liberty  this enigmatic enemy planned on turning  everyone on america's east coast into  obedient zombies  wu reveals in the following issue that  the mastermind behind this thwarted plan  is the yellow claw who was long thought  to be dead  as for wu he officially joined shield in  1968's nick fury agent of shield number  two  even helps the agency fight godzilla  when the giant lizard attacks north  america on the 24 issue godzilla series  released between 1977 and 1979.  wu appears in a six-part mini-series  from 1988 entitled nick fury vs shield  or does he the first issue begins with  an advanced idea mechanic ship filled  with hydra agents attacking fury's squad  they managed to steal a power core from  a downed helicarrier fury tracks the  core to the roxon industrial research  complex in new jersey through a sleeper  agent named jack rowlands  fury reports his findings to the shield  executive board and they respond by  sending wu to kill roland's  wu and the board are actually advanced  versions of shield androids called life  model decoys or  lmd's as the shield satellite explodes  near the end of the mini series the wu  lmd decides to stay behind and die like  a human  although the real jimmy wu was thought  to be dead at this time 1993's nickbury  agent of shield number 43 and number 44  revealed that he was one of four agents  put in stasis and brainwashed by hydra  fortunately they are all deep programmed  a few issues later  with the agents of atlas series that  started in 2006 wu led his first comic  in almost 50 years  authority looks good on you jimmy  the first issue of this series reveals  that an elderly wu went rogue and  commanded a team of disenfranchised  shield agents on a raid of the san  francisco branch of the fiendish atlas  foundation  they traveled into a secret room where  the whole team was killed except wu  who was put on life support the only  clues shield can gather link wu's  mission to a short-lived crime-fighting  group from the late 1950s called the  g-men  the agency's sub-director timothy  dum-dum-dugen brings in guerilla man a  member of the g-man for questioning as  he's the only g-man member they can get  a hold of  looking for answers gorilla man secretly  contacts two other g-men members  a robot named m11 and a super-powered  human with genetically engineered  uranium physiology named  marvel boy they helped break wu out of  the hidden shield facility  using his last mental impression of wu  marvel boy restructures him which  restores wu to his 1950s self  at the expense of his memories from the  last 50 years  with his youth regained wu reforms the  agents of atlas to find more leads on  the atlas foundation  derek kanata a wakandan shield agent and  investigator of wu's case travels to  wu's house in order to search for more  clues but the g-men are already there  they initially intend to leave kanata  behind until he says he knows the  location of g-man member venus who can  affect men with her singing  the team travels to africa where they  meet venus and fight the yellow claw  robot  they later travel to antarctica to find  nomura cousin of the atlantean king  namor  who initially refused to join the g-man  and was long thought to be dead  fortunately she's very much alive and  joins the team this time after m11  unfreezes her from her icy coffin wu and  his team subsequently raid several shady  organizations with the name  atlas they finally take a break in fiji  and agents of atlas number four  where they encounter the yellow claw now  known as the golden claw  the team discovers that m11 is a double  agent and after a fight breaks out  between them wu  asks m11 to cut his connection to the  golden claw the final issue of the 2006  agents of atlas series offers a major  reveal for jimmy wu  the team enters the atlas foundation's  secret room in san francisco where they  confront a giant talking dragon named mr  lao  advisor to the atlas foundation's leader  he reveals the organization's origins in  the mongol empire and the golden claw's  real name  even more dramatically it turns out that  wu whose chinese name is wu yen jet was  chosen to be the golden claw successor  shortly after he was born  wu's parents however wanted no  involvement they moved to america and  urged their son to pursue law  enforcement  mr lau believed that if wu could rise up  through the ranks of government his  reputation would grow exponentially  thus when wu was an fbi agent during the  1950s atlas positioned the yellow clause  his nemesis so that the american  government would trust him and his  profile would grow  after learning the truth about who he  really is wu finally takes his place as  the ceo of the atlas foundation  the golden claw then enters mr lyle's  mouth sacrificing himself so that the  rest of the organization will not  question wu's rule with kanata  concealing the team's continued  existence the shield wu and the agents  of atlas enter a strange new future  in issues number 8 through 11 of the  2009 agents of atlas series wu decides  to search for his long-lost loves who  won  mr lao tells wu that after atlas lost  track of him suwon threw herself into  the work of the organization  and was quite good at it too the golden  claw eventually let her run her own  group called the great wall  but after he asked juwan to step down  her loyalists rebelled causing a rift in  the empire  wu travels to china through the dragon's  corridor an alternate dimension  controlled by the atlas foundation to  speak with suwon who now goes by the  moniker jake claw  since wu was violated the atlas great  wall treaty the jade claw attempts to  hold him hostage  but of course wu and his team fight back  the jade claw continues to attack the  atlas foundation's operations until wu's  team once again attacks the great walls  home base  with her force defeated the jade claw  surrenders and wu lets her live to  represent her people  wu leaves the second in command to  oversee the great wall and bring it in  line with the new atlas foundation  in 2013's infinity the hunt number one  it's revealed that wu has co-created a  superhero school with a former super  villain called the pan asian school for  the unusually gifted  this school is located in mumbai and  recruits students from all over asia  this institution is one of many  superhero schools chosen to compete in  the contest of champions  a competition created by hank kim as the  sort of marvel youth olympics  the three students selected to compete  on behalf of the pan-asian school are  the tech genius known as gang the  tendril generating being known as pompom  and a modern incarnation of hindu god  durga  known as sri this initial meaning  between schools is interrupted when  thanos's forces attack earth  in the end the students from each school  work together to defend wakanda  issues number 15 through 18 of 2016's  the totally awesome hulk see woo team up  with a variety of other asian  superheroes  here the head of atlas appears alongside  amadeus cho's hulk  shang chi miss marvel silk and shield  agent jack o at a charity event in  manhattan to raise awareness for asian  american bone marrow donation  they then hang out in korea town and  quickly become friends  unfortunately the group's evening is  interrupted when the extraterrestrial  imperial guard of the planet secnar 7  arrive in new york  although these heroes initially beat the  alien invaders they and the nearby  civilians are transported across the  universe to secnar 7.  the team officially becomes the  protectors in order to keep the  civilians safe from alien threats until  alpha flight arrives to pick them up the  protector is eventually fused with  another superhero team  during 2019's war of the realms event wu  invites the protectors to become the new  agents of atlas  along with a few other heroes while the  team has grown and changed over time  wu's role is a heroic intelligent leader  is remain consistent  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite comic book heroes and  villains are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

